	<TextRow
		Label="pw_briefing_001"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ][Name:PokemonNickname ]ニンジャの　たびかさなる
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]だつごくに　しびれを　きらした　
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]こくさいコップは　ついに
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]ほういさくせんを　けっこう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T05:15:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ][Name:PokemonNickname ]ニンジャの　度重なる
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]脱獄に　しびれを　きらした　
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]国際コップは　ついに
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]包囲作戦を　決行</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-26T05:15:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>あらすじ♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-08-02T11:01:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
